{"data":{"manga":{"id":30977,"rank":15689,"title":"Oshimai","alternativeTitle":"Four-Page Stories; Oshi-Mai: Four Page Stories; 4 Page Stories; おしまい; お四枚; OSHI-MAI - Four Page Storys; Marie to Natsu no Umi (マリエと夏の海); Tonkagya-san de no Manner (とんかっ屋さんでのマナー); 〇〇 nao Nee-san (〇〇なお姉さん); 〇〇 na Present (〇〇なプレゼント); Himitsu no Are (秘密のアレ); Tatoerunara (例えるなら); Succubus Moriko-chan (サキュバス モリ子ちゃん); Koushoujin Mashike Masaomi (交渉人 増毛正臣); Pierce no Okayama-san (ピアスの岡山さん); Ichiko to Maya (イチコとマヤ); Toshishita no Otokonoko ni Are Shichau Hanashi (年下の男の子にアレしちゃう話); Otsupai Undermining Kouka (おつぱいアンダーマイニング効果); Katei Kyoushi no JK ga Usugi (家庭教師のJKが薄着); Chuu-2 Danshi no Nichijou (中2男子の日常); Fumio to Masashi (フ三オとマサシ); Bouken Otomesan A-chan (冒険乙女三アちゃん); Serizawa-san no Houkago (芹沢さんの放課後); Battle Manga Couple Niari-Gachina Asa no Koukei (バトル漫画カップルにありがちな朝の光景); Enkaku no Are (遠隔のアレ); Tensai Planner Kyouko (天才プランナー京子); Valentine Hunter Matsuzaki (バレンタインハンター松崎); Are no Namae (アレの名前); Awanai Futari (あわないふたり); Itsudemo Dokodemo Hata-chan (いつでもどこでも八田ちゃん); Do Seiso Moeri-chan (ド清楚もえりちゃん)...","slug":"oshimai","mainSlug":"oshimai","status":"completed","image":"md/oshimai.jpg","latestChapter":21,"genres":"Romance, Comedy, Slice of Life, Animals, School Life, Anthology, Web Comic, Erotica","author":"Kawasaki Tadataka","artist":"Kawasaki Tadataka","isWebtoon":true,"isYaoi":false,"isPorn":false,"isSoftPorn":true,"isSafe":true,"isLicensed":false,"description":"A collection of twitter published manga by Kawasaki Tadataka, they're described as &quot;short, ecchi&quot; comedy. 19 chapters in all, they're available in the Japanese Amazon site for FREE as Kindle e-book. It's not region or DRM locked.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Some of them have been previously translated as twitter shorts and are available as oneshots on MangaDex. I will not be re-translating them at this time.","createdDate":"2020-05-26T22:57:36.000Z","updatedDate":"2026-03-15T20:08:21.000Z","chapters":[{"id":623378,"number":1,"title":"Marie at the Su